5.INVERTED RIGHT ANGLE TRIANGLE
Given an integer n. Write a program to print the inverted "Right angle triangle" wall. 
The length of the perpendicular and base is n.
SOURCE CODE :
        class Solution {
            public void printPattern(int n) {
                for(int i=n;i>=1;i--){
                    for(int j=i;j>=1;j--){
                        System.out.print("* ");
                    }
                    System.out.println();
                }
            }
        }
